                        Discover {totalCategories}+ categories with {totalCourses}+ Udemy courses. Find your perfect learning path in development, design, business, marketing, and more with our curated coupons and deals.
                    </p>

                    {/* Statistics Badges */}
                    <div style={{
                        display: "flex",
                        justifyContent: "center",
                        gap: "1rem",
                        flexWrap: "wrap",
                        marginBottom: "3rem"
                    }}>
                        <div style={{
                            display: "flex",
