                        </h2>
                        <p style={{
                            color: "var(--muted)",
                            fontSize: "1.1rem",
                            maxWidth: "600px",
                            margin: "0 auto",
                            lineHeight: 1.6
                        }}>
                            From programming to photography, explore diverse learning paths with thousands of discounted courses
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div style={{
                        display: "grid",
                        gridTemplateColumns: "repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr))",
